# ChatDDB — local Worker secrets
#
# 1. Copy this file to `.dev.vars` (same directory). `.dev.vars` is gitignored.
# 2. Paste your AgentRouter key(s) below (get one at https://agentrouter.org/console/token).
# 3. Run `npm run dev:all`.
#
# For the deployed Worker, set them as real secrets instead:
#   npx wrangler secret put AGENTROUTER_API_KEY
#   npx wrangler secret put AGENTROUTER_API_KEY_2
#   npx wrangler secret put AGENTROUTER_API_KEY_3

AGENTROUTER_API_KEY=sk-replace-me
# AGENTROUTER_API_KEY_2=sk-replace-me
# AGENTROUTER_API_KEY_3=sk-replace-me

# The silent fallback gateway (optional). With this set, an AgentRouter outage
# stops being visible: freemodel.dev answers instead, and the user is not told.
# Get a key at https://freemodel.dev — it is metered ($5 signup credit, then
# paid), so watch for `upstream_failover` rows in the admin activity log.
# Deployed:  npm run secret:freemodel
# FREEMODEL_API_KEY=fm-replace-me

# The backup image provider (optional). With this set, an exhausted Workers AI
# allowance stops being visible: Pollinations draws the image instead. It is
# metered, so watch for `image_failover` rows in the admin activity log.
# Get a key at https://auth.pollinations.ai
# Deployed:  npm run secret:pollinations
# POLLINATIONS_API_KEY=pk-replace-me

# Optional overrides — defaults live in wrangler.jsonc `vars`.
# AGENTROUTER_MODEL=gpt-5.6-sol
# AGENTROUTER_BASE_URL=https://agentrouter.org/v1
# MAX_OUTPUT_TOKENS=8192
# REASONING_EFFORT=medium
# FREEMODEL_MODEL=gpt-5.5
# FREEMODEL_BASE_URL=https://freemodel.dev/v1
# FALLBACK_ENABLED=false          # kill switch: stops crossover, keeps the key
# POLLINATIONS_MODEL=flux
# POLLINATIONS_BASE_URL=https://gen.pollinations.ai
# POLLINATIONS_ENABLED=false      # kill switch for the image crossover
# RATE_TOOL_IMAGE_PER_DAY=5       # images the model may request per user per day
# Both of these are answers `npm run probe:freemodel` gives you. Only set them
# if the probe says the defaults are wrong for the model you picked.
# FREEMODEL_TOKEN_PARAM=max_tokens
# FREEMODEL_REASONING_EFFORT=false
